45,2,3,talk,Minato,,I think a tool that handles the handover notes would help the staff.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"The developer availability is poor, so we need low maintenance.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"Fixed-fee work is stable, so a one-off build might be affordable.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"The narrow tools for one trade still run, so let us pick a narrow one.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The misrouted deliveries are due to duplicate records, not inexperience.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
